flowchart TD
    A[Teacher provides situation] --> B[Check available details]
    B --> C[Use required AI prompt]
    C --> D[AI generates email draft]
    D --> E[Check subject and polite tone]
    E --> F[Check deadline placeholder and next steps]
    F --> G{Draft meets requirements?}
    G -- No --> H[Edit prompt or revise draft]
    H --> D
    G -- Yes --> I[Human approves draft]
    I --> J[Save draft for manual use]
    J --> K[No automatic sending]
